<title>UK: Southern Electric sees yr dividend up 10 pct.</title>
<headline>Southern Electric sees yr dividend up 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>British regional electricity firm Southern Electric Plc said on Thursday it expected to recommend a total dividend of 43p per share for the year, representing a 10 percent rise from last year's level.</p>
<p>The company also said it planned to maintain its policy of growing dividends by five to eight percent in real terms until the year 2000.</p>
</text>
